#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit. Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Local Open Scope ring_scope. Variable R : realType. Variables U T V S Q R : R * R. Definition collinear A B C := let: (x1,y1):=A in let: (x2,y2):=B in let: (x3,y3):=C in (x2-x1)*(y3-y1) = (y2-y1)*(x3-x1). Definition length A B := Num.sqrt ((fst B-fst A)^2+(snd B-snd A)^2). Theorem trapezoid_UT_length : collinear Q V U -> collinear R S T -> (length Q R = 5) -> (length V S = 11) -> (fst Q < fst R) -> (fst V < fst S) -> length U T = 17. Proof. move=> QVU RST QR5 VS11 _ _. by []. Qed.
